    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// A drum chart, which is mostly words (docs/prompts/70)." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "//" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// The reason this piece is in the corpus is that almost everything a drum" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// chart communicates is a printed direction rather than a note: which sample" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// the pad is loaded with, where the drop is, when the lights change. Those are" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// notation — a chart prints them above the staff exactly like a text direction" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// — and they are table rows here rather than a second language bolted on." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "//" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// Triggering the sample is the studio's job. `mark sample` prints a name; it" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// does not load anything. That separation is the same one the whole program is" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// built on: a part is not a synthesizer." },
